# Ingris Stingerquill: "that creature deals 1 damage to each opponent" - the attacking creature is the damage's source (CR 120.3),
# so a lifelinked one gains its controller life (CR 702.15b). On turn 3 Bot1 attacks with Ingris and a Healer's Hawk (1/1
# flying lifelink): Ingris's trigger and the Hawk's deal 1 each (Bot2 20 to 18, the Hawk's gaining Bot1 1 life, Ingris's gaining
# none), then combat damage of 1 each takes Bot2 to 16 and gains Bot1 1 more: Bot1 is at 22. In turn 4 Bot2 attacks with its
# Ornithopter: not a creature Bot1 controls, so Ingris does nothing and Bot2 stays at 16.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Black Lotus
Ingris Stingerquill
Healer's Hawk
Mountain
Mountain x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Forest x14

